Verification, Testing & Operational Protocol
Follow this checklist to validate system operational health before pushing changes across branches:
1. Kustomize Overlay Manifest Validation
Render and inspect environment-specific Kubernetes manifests locally before committing:
# Render and inspect Dev Overlay
kubectl kustomize manifests/overlays/dev/

# Render and inspect Production Overlay
kubectl kustomize manifests/overlays/prod/

